{"skill":{"slug":"video-edit","displayName":"Video Editing"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770861854973,"changelog":"Initial release","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":2677,"sha256":"3a41dd5ec69c0019cc4bc85506eb95996075a25c6f3ae3d331a864b454e9b21f","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"audio.md","size":2825,"sha256":"7ac394245279b0781cbd6b1748bc41e1b49b55005aa1d607d6b352aaf55db881","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"background-removal.md","size":2305,"sha256":"d1dadee374248e2c2969e418d62f289a898e340651ad1b9f45a1d7420caab62d","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"color-grading.md","size":2648,"sha256":"b28ab66dc7146815b4a1d5b0095bb741582006440548ef6f0bfaf2a41d8918bd","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"effects.md","size":2986,"sha256":"38b426dd56303d7abaca9fb19e4d5132cedbd0630401a549d424131f02e2741d","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"stabilization.md","size":2703,"sha256":"557fabb6e70e8807c082623ad293216b3b071bd3a518913d543aaad55b37ed28","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"tools.md","size":2682,"sha256":"7ebe540601d6c0392477c19acb5a7b51ff924063c062f2ab0720ebf32e816bde","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"upscaling.md","size":2556,"sha256":"d55cff98751db9a6bba557e5d6f911a25d09f8407166b7302e7cb9448ba1de1b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2255,"sha256":"a000f995043ed463a5ffe6595bfd98f6a9d19ebc560db355d1ccb51a967cae97","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789062292092,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"08717f8f3eb6d4849af11e12b18236fe74cf215da6ccb0e204b9cf4111101cf0","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/08717f8f3eb6d4849af11e12b18236fe74cf215da6ccb0e204b9cf4111101cf0","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: video-edit\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle is classified as suspicious due to the inclusion of the `roop` (face swap) tool in `effects.md`, which is explicitly noted as 'controversial' with 'ethical concerns'. While the skill bundle itself does not instruct malicious use, this capability is inherently high-risk due to its potential for misuse (e.g., deepfakes) if the agent is not properly constrained or if user consent is not strictly enforced. Additionally, several files (`background-removal.md`, `effects.md`, `upscaling.md`) contain shell commands and loops that process user-provided files, which could introduce shell injection vulnerabilities if the agent does not adequately sanitize input.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779163370078},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":42,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":18,"checkedAt":1789062292092},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"This video-editing skill is mostly coherent, but it needs Review because it gives cloud media-upload and face-swap guidance without adequate privacy, consent, or safety scoping.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Local file processing and cloud APIs are proportionate for video editing, but sending videos or audio to Runway, Unscreen, Replicate, Adobe, or similar providers should be more clearly disclosed because media can contain sensitive or proprietary content.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The skill package itself is Markdown and has no installer, but its instructions include unpinned pip installs for tools such as rife-ncnn-vulkan, video2x, and demucs.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill is user-directed and tells agents to preserve originals, but multiple examples upload or reference user media with third-party services and the face-swap section only says to use it responsibly, without meaningful consent, privacy, or anti-impersonation guidance.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"I found no instructions for persistence, privilege escalation, background services, credential-store access, or automatic execution outside user-invoked examples.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Most capabilities fit the stated video-editing purpose, including background removal, grading, upscaling, stabilization, audio cleanup, and effects. The face-swap and apparent age-modification section materially increases misuse risk and is only weakly scoped.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"concern"}],"guidance":"Review this skill before installing if you handle private, regulated, workplace, client, or identity-sensitive media. Use local workflows for confidential footage, avoid uploading media to third-party APIs unless you accept that provider's terms, keep API keys secure, use isolated environments for pip-installed tools, and do not use face-swap or age-modification workflows without clear consent and lawful, non-deceptive intent.","findings":"[E1] expected: The external API calls are real and purpose-aligned for cloud video processing, but the artifacts under-disclose that user media or media URLs may leave the local environment.\n[SQP-2] unexpected: The missing privacy, retention, consent, and sensitive-media guidance is a valid concern across the cloud upload examples and the face-swap section.\n[SDI-1] unexpected: The face-swap and age-modification material is visible in the effects file, but it is not clearly disclosed in the main description and lacks adequate guardrails for identity manipulation.\n[T08] expected: Installing external video/audio tools is expected for this skill, but floating pip installs are a supply-chain risk that should be handled with pinned versions and isolated environments.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789062292092}}}}}